{"annotations":{"destructiveHint":false,"idempotentHint":true,"openWorldHint":false,"readOnlyHint":true},"description":"A day of Marselia's tarot Advent calendar (1 to 24 December): 1 upright Tarot de Marseille card a day, the same for everyone, drawn by a published SHA-256 rule (24 different cards), with the validated card-of-the-day text in the language asked, the card plate URL (public domain BnF scan, show it whole in its 440:827 frame), the card page, the Marselia Academy lesson to learn it and the calendar page. Day 1 to 24, default today (Paris time). A day opens on its own Paris day: an earlier request answers that it is not open yet, and no future card is ever given. A theme for the day, never a prediction. Free, takes no question. Cite Marselia and the calendar URL.","execution":{"taskSupport":"forbidden"},"inputSchema":{"$schema":"http://json-schema.org/draft-07/schema#","additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"day":{"maximum":24,"minimum":1,"type":"integer"},"locale":{"default":"en","enum":["en","fr","es","it","ar","tr","de","pt","nl","zh","ja","ko"],"type":"string"}},"type":"object"},"name":"marselia_advent_card","outputSchema":{"$schema":"http://json-schema.org/draft-07/schema#","additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"archiveUntil":{"minLength":1,"type":"string"},"attribution":{"minLength":1,"type":"string"},"card":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"date":{"minLength":1,"type":"string"},"dateLabel":{"minLength":1,"type":"string"},"day":{"maximum":24,"minimum":1,"type":"integer"},"id":{"pattern":"^[A-Z]\\d{2}$","type":"string"},"image":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"alt":{"minLength":1,"type":"string"},"height":{"maximum":9007199254740991,"minimum":-9007199254740991,"type":"integer"},"path":{"minLength":1,"type":"string"},"url":{"format":"uri","type":"string"},"width":{"maximum":9007199254740991,"minimum":-9007199254740991,"type":"integer"}},"required":["url","path","width","height","alt"],"type":"object"},"learn":{"additi